# deepseek-whale-pet
===
 A small, transparent whale that stays pinned to the bottom-right corner of your desktop, providing real-time updates on your DeepSeek balance and daily usage. You can drag it around, click it to hear it make sounds, and it even speaks random lines; it runs completely independently, without relying on DSH or a web browser.
